ils about the applicant\\u2019s current residence are typically provided in descriptive sentence form. For example:\\n\\u201cApplicant is married and residing in a rented house at H No. E7/112, Arera Colony, Bhopal.\\u201d\\n\\nFrom such narrative statements, the applicant\\u2019s current residence type\\u2014such as Rented, Owned, Lease House, or similar\\u2014can be identified.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Employer_Name\",\n    \"description\": \"In The PD (Word Document) Sections like About Applicants, About Employment, or any other similar section, you will often find descriptive statements like:\\n\\n\\u201cApplicant is currently working with M/S Sateri Kirana Store.\\u201d\\n\\nFrom such narrative lines, the applicant\\u2019s Employer Name can be identified\\u2014for example, in this case, the employer name would be M/S Sateri Kirana Store.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Assesed_Income\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the Income Details section, there is a field labeled \\u201cTotal Assessed Income.\\u201d typically contains values such as 1,00,000, 32,000, and other similar income amounts.\"\n  }\n]\n\nInstructions:\nFor CAM Some of content is from excel provided as plain text, where each sheet starts with a divider and its name, like:\n============================================================\n[SHEET: SheetName]\n============================================================\nFor each field, extract the value based on its description, searching only within the relevant sheet and its data section.\nIf a field is not found or not applicable in the specified sheet, use null as its value.\nReturn a JSON object with field names as keys and extracted values as values.\n", "response": "{\n  \"Sourcing_City_Name\": \"Bhopal\",\n  \"Branch_Name\": \"Bhopal\",\n  \"Final_Sanctioned_Amount\": 3000000,\n  \"Sanction_Loan_Period\": 240,\n  \"Sanction_Interest_Rate\": 12.00,\n  \"Loan_Type\": \"Composite Loan (Plot Purchase plus Home Construction)\",\n  \"Type_Of_Employment_Loan\": \"Proprietor\",\n  \"Foir\": 55.06,\n  \"Sole_Child\": \"No\",\n  \"Employer_Type\": \"Individual\",\n  \"Employer_Designation\": \"Proprietor of Firm M/S Om construction\",\n  \"Months_In_Total_Employment\": 36,\n  \"Years_In_Total_Employment\": 3,\n  \"Mode_Of_Salary\": \"Bank Deposit\",\n  \"Office_SetUp\": \"Resi-cum-Office Setup\",\n  \"Lender_PD_Status\": \"Positive\",\n  \"Marital_Status\": \"Married\",\n  \"Level_Of_Studies\": \"Graduate\",\n  \"Number_Of_Dependents\": 4,\n  \"Current_Residence\": \"Rented\",\n  \"Employer_Name\": \"M/S Om construction\",\n  \"Assesed_Income\": 100000\n}"}
