cupation/Business Details section, the field \\u201cSalaried / Self Employed\\u201d typically contains values such as Salaried, SENP, and other similar classifications.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Borrower_Entity_Type\",\n    \"description\": \"Logic: If the gender is Male or Female, mark the PAS field as Individual.\\nIf the applicant is a Company or any other entity, mark it as Non-Individual.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Gender\",\n    \"description\": \"In the Application Form, under the Personal Details section, there is a field labeled \\u201cGender.\\u201d\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Marital_Status\",\n    \"description\": \"In the Application Form, under the Personal Details section, the field \\u201cMarital Status\\u201d typically contains values such as Married, Single, and similar statuses.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Level_Of_Studies\",\n    \"description\": \"In the Application Form, under the Personal Details section, the field \\u201cQualification\\u201d typically contains values such as Graduate and other similar educational qualifications.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Current_Residence\",\n    \"description\": \"In the Application Form, under the Personal Details section, the field \\u201cCurrent Residence\\u201d typically contains values such as Rented, Owned, Lease House, and other similar residence types.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Employer_Name\",\n    \"description\": \"In the Application Form, under the Occupation/Business Details section, the field \\u201cCompany Name\\u201d typically contains values such as Madhya Pradesh Madhyam, Om Constructions, and other similar organization names.\"\n  }\n]\n\nInstructions:\nFor CAM Some of content is from excel provided as plain text, where each sheet starts with a divider and its name, like:\n============================================================\n[SHEET: SheetName]\n============================================================\nFor each field, extra