arried, Single, or other applicable statuses\\u2014can be extracted.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Level_Of_Studies\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the About Applicants section, the information is usually presented in sentence form\\u2014for example: \\u201cApplicant Mr. Kanhaiya Bharti is about 49 years of age and is a BA graduate by qualification.\\u201d Similar narrative statements may appear, from which the applicant\\u2019s qualification can be extracted.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Current_Residence\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the About Applicants section, details about the applicant\\u2019s current residence are typically provided in descriptive sentence form. For example:\\n\\u201cApplicant is married and residing in a rented house at H No. E7/112, Arera Colony, Bhopal.\\u201d\\n\\nFrom such narrative statements, the applicant\\u2019s current residence type\\u2014such as Rented, Owned, Lease House, or similar\\u2014can be identified.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Employer_Name\",\n    \"description\": \"In The PD (Word Document) Sections like About Applicants, About Employment, or any other similar section, you will often find descriptive statements like:\\n\\n\\u201cApplicant is currently working with M/S Sateri Kirana Store.\\u201d\\n\\nFrom such narrative lines, the applicant\\u2019s Employer Name can be identified\\u2014for example, in this case, the employer name would be M/S Sateri Kirana Store.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Assesed_Income\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the Income Details section, there is a field labeled \\u201cTotal Assessed Income.\\u201d typically contains values such as 1,00,000, 32,000, and other similar income amounts.\"\n  }\n]\n\nInstructions:\nFor CAM Some of content is from excel provided as plain text, where each sheet starts with a divider and its name, like:\n==================================================