er sections such as About Applicant, About Employment, or Applicant Personal Details\\u2014or any similar sections\\u2014there will typically be explicit mentions of the applicant\\u2019s work experience in the form of months, years, or sometimes specific dates. If a date is provided, the corresponding years and months must be calculated up to the current date.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Years_In_Total_Employment\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under sections such as About Applicant, About Employment, or Applicant Personal Details\\u2014or any similar sections\\u2014there will typically be explicit mentions of the applicant\\u2019s work experience in the form of months, years, or sometimes specific dates. If a date is provided, the corresponding years must be calculated up to the current date and if months are provided then the given months must be converted into an equivalent year count.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Mode_Of_Salary\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the \\\"About Employment\\\" section or similar areas, look for keywords like \\\"having cash salary\\\" or comparable phrases/statements. Analyze these to determine whether the salary mode is cash or SALARY REFLECTED IN BANK.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Office_SetUp\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the Income Details section, the field \\u201cBusiness Setup Details\\u201d typically contains values such as Resi-cum-Office Setup or Permanent Structure or other similar relevant descriptions.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Marital_Status\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the About Applicants section, you will typically find statements such as \\u201cApplicant is married and residing in a rented house at H No. E7/112, Arera Colony, Bhopal.\\u201d These statements may appear in different wording or under differently named sections. From such sentences, marital status\\u2014such as Married, Single, or other applicable statuses\\u2014can be extracted.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Level_Of_Studies\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the About Applicants section, the information is usually presented in sentence form\\u2014for example: \\u201cApplicant Mr. Kanhaiya Bharti is about 49 years of age and is a BA graduate by qualification.\\u201d Similar narrative statements may appear, from which the applicant\\u2019s qualification can be extracted.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Current_Residence\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the About Applicants section, details about the applicant\\u2019s current residence are typically provided in descriptive sentence form. For example:\\n\\u201cApplicant is married and residing in a rented house at H No. E7/112, Arera Colony, Bhopal.\\u201d\\n\\nFrom such narrative statements, the applicant\\u2019s current residence type\\u2014such as Rented, Owned, Lease House, or similar\\u2014can be identified.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Employer_Name\",\n    \"description\": \"In The PD (Word Document) Sections like About Applicants, About Employment, or any other similar section, you will often find descriptive statements like:\\n\\n\\u201cApplicant is currently working with M/S Sateri Kirana Store.\\u201d\\n\\nFrom such narrative lines, the applicant\\u2019s Employer Name can be identified\\u2014for example, in this case, the employer name would be M/S Sateri Kirana Store.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"field_name\": \"Assesed_Income\",\n    \"description\": \"In the PD (Word document), under the Income Details section, there is a field labeled \\u201cTotal Assessed Income.\\u201d typically contains values such as 1,00,000, 32,000, and other similar income amounts.\"\n  }\n]\n\nInstructions:\nFor CAM Some of content is from excel provided as plain text, where each sheet starts with a divider and its name, like:\n==================================================